local_inference's tool/native/llamadart-native-v0.4.0.sha256). The archives hold no license file; the licenses below
were read in the sources those libraries are built from. Their full texts are in local_inference's
NATIVE_LICENSES.txt: local_inference_flutter registers them with Flutter's LicenseRegistry in every Flutter app built
on it, and a command-line tool ships the file (local_inference's README, "License and notices").

